# Merriam-Webster proxy base URL.
#
# Leave this EMPTY for production and for `vercel dev`: the app and the /api/mw
# proxy are served from the same origin, so a relative "/api/mw" just works.
#
# Set it ONLY for plain `npm run dev` (the vite dev server on :8205), which has
# no proxy of its own. Point it at the deployed origin so lookups reach the
# live function during local development. It is a URL, not a secret.
#
# VITE_MW_PROXY_BASE=https://word-savor-git-main-ruthnie-benoits-projects.vercel.app
